# Pseudo font size is locked at 18px

Player names, opponent names, and friend display names (**pseudos**) use **`UiTokens.PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE` (18)** everywhere in the app.

## Do

- Use `UiTokens.PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE` for any label that shows a player/opponent/friend pseudo
- Keep history, friends, leaderboard rows, and similar list tiles on 18

## Don’t

- Hardcode another size for a pseudo without an explicit user ask
- Shrink or grow pseudos to “fix” layout — prefer clipping / internal reflow (see `text-overlap-sizing.mdc`)

## Exception

- Profile **hero** display name may stay larger until the user asks to change it
